    <expertiseList>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/e935d324656e44e29baacfdb2a1c2f85"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/8a325ded94954f778a271abad70be344"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/42fd6cb4bd094a1baac98d798ea9e5cb"}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/e935d324656e44e29baacfdb2a1c2f85","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Soil Testing"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/8a325ded94954f778a271abad70be344","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Concrete Strength Testing"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/42fd6cb4bd094a1baac98d798ea9e5cb","PropType":null,"stringItemText":"Asphalt Verification and Testing"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </expertiseList>
    <grid>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/973ae0944926460898777001f0783ea2","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/973ae0944926460898777001f0783ea2","content":"\u003cdiv class=\"\" data-block=\"true\" data-editor=\"758bl\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"_1mf _1mj\" data-offset-key=\"dadl7-0-0\"\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTwo major Roadlab site laboratories completed their work this month. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach conclusion reflects accredited processes, rigorous compliance, and reliable data — delivering the confidence that projects will perform as designed, and the trust that results will stand the test of time.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/2erg2au0/september-projects.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/dvqkvux2/kusile-power-station.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eKusile Power Station \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRoadlab has completed its role at Kusile Power Station, our longest-running project, concluding 14 years of testing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur dedicated team delivered a full scope of quality assurance testing required for one of SA\u0027s most critical power stations. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOver the project lifetime we samples many tons of soil, asphalt and concrete, performed thousands of density tests and conducted investigations including concrete strength testing, crack measurements and Dynamic Cone Penetrometer testing. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThese efforts ensured the quality, safety, and long-term durability of works at Kusile, which continues to play a central role in electricity distribution across the country.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/pgomtgrf/kusile.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/5mcn0ffa/concluding-kusile.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBloemhof Road Maintainence\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe X.004-128 Bloemhof project has successfully concluded, improving rural access and strengthening one of the North West’s key corridors.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRoadlab supported the works with soil and asphalt testing, compaction checks, and density verification, ensuring that materials delivered long-term stability in a demanding environment. \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/ge1a2sv3/bloemhof-road-project-testing.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eCommitment to Quality: A SANAS-Accredited Facility\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt Roadlab, quality is what we do.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis commitment to excellence shapes how we support infrastructure development across the Western Cape — from dense urban upgrades to remote renewable energy builds.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBy continually refining our geotechnical, concrete, and materials testing processes, we help ensure that the region’s roads, bridges, coastal structures, and wind farms are built to endure.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur work is underpinned by strict adherence to SANAS accreditation standards, ensuring that every test we perform meets national and international benchmarks for accuracy, reliability, and compliance.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe\u0027re ready to answer your questions. \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3\"\u003eReach out below.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/0cbovclm/western-cape-construction-quality.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/paohvimw/western-cape-construction-quality-assurance.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </grid>
    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "markup": "<p>October saw the conclusion of the Mabunyaneng and Khubelu Bridges in the Lesotho Highlands, the 14-year Kusile Power Station programme in Mpumalanga and vital national and regional corridors in the North-West and Free State — each strengthened by Roadlab’s accredited testing.</p>",
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": []
  }
}]]></Value>
    </heroContent>
